WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:02.166
I've been to the rainforest
我曾去过雨林

00:00:02.233 --> 00:00:03.700
To the ocean
海洋

00:00:03.733 --> 00:00:05.366
To the snow mountains
和雪山

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:08.633
met situations I least expected
也遇到了最出乎预料的情况

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.433
I was looking for more creative ways
我在寻找更有创意的方法

00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:12.366
to explore the world
来探索这个世界

00:00:12.366 --> 00:00:13.666
That's when i thought
那时我就想

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:15.133
Let's give discovery a call
来联络探索频道试试看

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.500
I want to leave the city life behind
我想抛开城市生活

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:22.333
Go deep into nature
深入大自然

00:00:22.333 --> 00:00:25.600
in search of something untamed
寻找那份狂野

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.933
Pure and mysterious
纯洁而神秘

00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:34.833
I thought i was leaving the concrete jungle behind
我以为我要远离了水泥丛林

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:36.233
But towering trees here
但这里的参天大树

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:38.100
remind me of tall buildings
却让我想起高楼大厦

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.800
and hum in the air of traffic
以及不绝于耳的车流声

00:00:44.733 --> 00:00:46.433
They say valleys and peaks
他们说山谷和山峰

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:49.000
mirror life's ups and downs
反映了生活的起起伏伏

00:00:49.066 --> 00:00:50.033
I wonder
我想知道

00:00:50.066 --> 00:00:54.566
Is that why mountains are sacred
这就是为什么山是神圣的吗？

00:00:54.566 --> 00:00:59.166
I hope this journey provides space for reflection and growth
我希望这次旅行能提供反思和成长的空间

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.500
Every peak
Whether in the career or on the mountain
每一座高峰
无论是在事业上还是在山上

00:01:02.566 --> 00:01:04.800
Comes with its own challenges
都有自己的挑战

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:07.233
We are in Gansu Ka，Qinghai
我们在青海的岗什卡

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:10.600
I will be climbing my first 5000-meter peak
我将攀登我的第一个5000米高峰

00:01:10.666 --> 00:01:12.533
Then snowboard my way back down
然后滑着滑雪板下山